> plot(climate.ar1$Q)

Have you checked the value of Q? I believe that it is NULL and, hence, it cannot be plotted. From your email, it is not clear to me what you want to do. The structure of the precision matrix of an AR1 is a known matrix (See, for example, the GMRF book by Rue and Held).

Best,

Virgilio

