the first thing is to make sure that you have implemented it correct,
for which you can keep noise_sd low and fixed, and you should be able to
get back the model you put in.

Use Gaussian response, as then there are no approximation errors, just
some numerical integration approximations.

the next step is to apply it to data, for which priors can make a
difference, as there are alternative interpretations of the same data

